      "side": 1,
      "message": "The iterator construction is non-trivial cost, right? So this pretty much makes it proportional to the number of language changes in the text? Not a problem, just want to understand the tradeoffs (and the potential failure modes).",
      "revId": "9ec0815bd8772ec82489c6d8f0f1abc60e32da13",
